  "net/minecraft/world/level/levelgen/feature/DripstoneUtils.getDripstoneHeight(DDDD)D": "wall_table found the rename (same code); DripstoneUtils is renamed here by hand, its class pairing being undecided there",
  "net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/ChunkAccess.markPosForPostprocessing(Lnet/minecraft/core/BlockPos;)V": "renames the generator left out (_pkgmoves_renamed_not_same_code), checked by javap: the bodies differ only in the warning's text ('PostProcessing' -> 'post processing'); ProtoChunk's override was the same code",
  "net/minecraft/server/PlayerAdvancements.stopListening()V": "26.1.2 removed this player's listeners from every trigger (trigger.removePlayerListeners(this)); 26.2 keeps a player's listeners in its own activeTriggers map, and clearTriggers() empties it -- what reload() calls in the place 26.1.2 called stopListening()",
  "net/minecraft/world/level/levelgen/SurfaceRules.noiseCondition(Lnet/minecraft/resources/ResourceKey;DD)Lnet/minecraft/world/level/levelgen/SurfaceRules$ConditionSource;": "26.1.2's NoiseThresholdConditionSource sampled NormalNoise.getValue(x, 0.0, z) (2D); 26.2's noiseCondition2d builds it with is3d = false (iconst_0), the 2D sampling; the one-threshold overload was the same code"
 },
